From: BPI-R4 firmware maintenance
Subject: [PATCH] iwinfo: recognize mtwifi UCI radio sections as a fallback

Adapt the mtwifi lookup from benboguan openwrt-25.12 while preserving
mac80211 priority. Reuse the existing path, MAC and phy resolution and
cleanup; this does not change vendor structures or synthesize a phy index.

--- a/iwinfo_nl80211.c
+++ b/iwinfo_nl80211.c
@@ -413,6 +413,8 @@
 	int idx = -1;
 
 	s = iwinfo_uci_get_radio(name, "mac80211");
+	if (!s)
+		s = iwinfo_uci_get_radio(name, "mtwifi");
 	if (!s)
 		goto out;
 
